# Ownership by directory. Each pattern's owners are auto-requested on PRs
# touching it. Later patterns win, so keep the catch-all first.
#
# To fill in: replace each PLACEHOLDER with @username or @org/team. Teams need
# write access to the repo or GitHub silently ignores them. Owners must be able
# to review the phase they own — the glossary owner settles what a word means,
# the migration owners settle whether a schema change is sound.
#
# Delete a line rather than leave a PLACEHOLDER: an unresolvable owner blocks
# nothing and reviews nothing.

* @PLACEHOLDER

